Subject: [PATCH 186/186] XD launcher: Real GBA (GB-Link) box and 'From GBA
 cartridge...' save import

Shows GB-Link/GBA status, a controller on/off toggle, and a per-port button that reads the
save from a cartridge in a real GBA (read-only, backup copy kept) and imports it through
the existing SaveImport path.
